  unitName: Dolce Megurine Luka
  unitId: 60584
  unitNumber: 8092
  description: A songstress who appeared from another world. Rumor has it that she
    appeared within the same ancient ruins where Hatsune Miku was found, quickly
    amassing a large number of audience members who grew captivated by her voice.
    Her ability to sing in mysterious languages made her especially popular amongst
    other singers of her time. Sweet and innocent, her music moved the hearts of
    many, filling their existence with joyous harmony. And though her voice was cool
    and husky, many claim that her feminine charm as a singer was a lovely sight
    to behold.
  summonDesc: The stage is bigger than I remember.<br>Guess that means there's more
    room to sing.<br>Well, here I go!
  fusionDesc: What is this music ringing in my ears?<br>I feel like it's revitalizing
    me...
  evoDesc: A sweet melody has stirred my heart.<br>Won't you sing along with me?
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
